 "description": "Compatibility alias of get_prices. Read measured EUR prices for one exact variant, with observed_at and quote scope. Null is unknown, never zero. Product guides do not filter condition, language or edition. One admitted API call consumes one shared account request, including admitted errors. No automatic retries.",
